    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You can use the smoke, noise, light, and confusion caused by your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grenade\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Grenade\">Grenade</a> attacks to move unseen near your foes.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When you damage a target with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Burst\">Burst</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Splash\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Splash\">Splash</a> weapon, you gain <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Concealment\" title=\"Concealment\">Concealment</a> against that target until the beginning of your next turn.</p>",
